Recently, many people have complained that Nethack 3.0 is too hard.
When complaining about the difficulty, it would help to mention whether
Nethack was compiled with the "HARD" option.  I find that this option
makes quite a difference.

However, I agree that it would be nice for Nethack to support multiple
levels of difficulty, with a separate score file for each level.  Of
course, this would need to be an option, to avoid burdening PC users with
too much code for 640K memory.

